#: ../../content/applications/studio/automated_actions.rst:572
msgid ""
"For automation rules that require the execution of :ref:`custom code "
"<studio/automated-actions/action-execute-code>`, note that maintenance of "
"custom code is not included in the *Standard* or *Custom* pricing plans and "
